    music2: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - sentenceType: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 31131cf5c56fa144b8d10d79464f4bf3, type: 2}
    text: Patrol is simple. We walk the halls and make sure everyone is where they
      should be.
    actions:
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 31131cf5c56fa144b8d10d79464f4bf3, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      actionType: 1
      coords: {x: 200, y: 0}
      moveSpeed: 0
      tintColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
      tintOpacity: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2e240942c73318642b0f986813494e10, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 12
      actionType: 0
      coords: {x: -200, y: 0}
      moveSpeed: 0
      tintColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
      tintOpacity: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 31131cf5c56fa144b8d10d79464f4bf3, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 1
      actionType: 4
      coords: {x: 200, y: 0}
      moveSpeed: 0
      tintColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
      tintOpacity: 0
    choice:
      prompt: 
      options: []
    endingScene: {fileID: 0}
    music: {fileID: 0}
    music2: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - sentenceType: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 31131cf5c56fa144b8d10d79464f4bf3, type: 2}
    text: If a student is out of class during lessons, ask for a hall pass.
    actions:
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2e240942c73318642b0f986813494e10, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 12
      actionType: 0
      coords: {x: -200, y: 0}
      moveSpeed: 0
      tintColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
      tintOpacity: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 31131cf5c56fa144b8d10d79464f4bf3, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 1
      actionType: 4
      coords: {x: 200, y: 0}
      moveSpeed: 0
      tintColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
      tintOpacity: 0
    choice:
      prompt: 
      options: []
    endingScene: {fileID: 0}
    music: {fileID: 0}
    music2: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - sentenceType: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2e240942c73318642b0f986813494e10, type: 2}
    text: What if they do not have one?
    actions:
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2e240942c73318642b0f986813494e10, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 13
      actionType: 4
      coords: {x: -200, y: 0}
      moveSpeed: 0
      tintColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
      tintOpacity: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 31131cf5c56fa144b8d10d79464f4bf3, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      actionType: 0
      coords: {x: 200, y: 0}
      moveSpeed: 0
      tintColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
      tintOpacity: 0
    choice:
      prompt: 
      options: []
    endingScene: {fileID: 0}
    music: {fileID: 0}
    music2: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - sentenceType: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 31131cf5c56fa144b8d10d79464f4bf3, type: 2}
    text: Then you walk them back to class. No raised voices. No threats.
    actions:
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2e240942c73318642b0f986813494e10, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 12
      actionType: 0
      coords: {x: -200, y: 0}
      moveSpeed: 0
      tintColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
      tintOpacity: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 31131cf5c56fa144b8d10d79464f4bf3, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 1
      actionType: 4
      coords: {x: 200, y: 0}
      moveSpeed: 0
      tintColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
      tintOpacity: 0
    choice:
      prompt: 
      options: []
    endingScene: {fileID: 0}
    music: {fileID: 0}
    music2: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - sentenceType: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2e240942c73318642b0f986813494e10, type: 2}
    text: Got it.
    actions:
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2e240942c73318642b0f986813494e10, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 13
      actionType: 4
      coords: {x: -200, y: 0}
      moveSpeed: 0
      tintColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
      tintOpacity: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 31131cf5c56fa144b8d10d79464f4bf3, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      actionType: 0
      coords: {x: 200, y: 0}
      moveSpeed: 0
      tintColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
      tintOpacity: 0
    choice:
      prompt: 
      options: []
    endingScene: {fileID: 0}
    music: {fileID: 0}
    music2: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - sentenceType: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 31131cf5c56fa144b8d10d79464f4bf3, type: 2}
    text: Watch the doors and windows too. A door left open means someone is hiding
      something.
    actions:
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2e240942c73318642b0f986813494e10, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 12
      actionType: 0
      coords: {x: -200, y: 0}
      moveSpeed: 0
      tintColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
      tintOpacity: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 31131cf5c56fa144b8d10d79464f4bf3, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 1
      actionType: 4
      coords: {x: 200, y: 0}
      moveSpeed: 0
      tintColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
      tintOpacity: 0
    choice:
      prompt: 
      options: []
    endingScene: {fileID: 0}
    music: {fileID: 0}
    music2: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - sentenceType: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2e240942c73318642b0f986813494e10, type: 2}
    text: Isnt that a little paranoid?
    actions:
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2e240942c73318642b0f986813494e10, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 13
      actionType: 4
      coords: {x: -200, y: 0}
      moveSpeed: 0
      tintColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
      tintOpacity: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 31131cf5c56fa144b8d10d79464f4bf3, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      actionType: 0
      coords: {x: 200, y: 0}
      moveSpeed: 0
      tintColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
      tintOpacity: 0
    choice:
      prompt: 
      options: []
    endingScene: {fileID: 0}
    music: {fileID: 0}
    music2: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - sentenceType: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 31131cf5c56fa144b8d10d79464f4bf3, type: 2}
    text: It is observant.
    actions:
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2e240942c73318642b0f986813494e10, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 12
      actionType: 0
      coords: {x: -200, y: 0}
      moveSpeed: 0
      tintColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
      tintOpacity: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 31131cf5c56fa144b8d10d79464f4bf3, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 1
      actionType: 4
      coords: {x: 200, y: 0}
      moveSpeed: 0
      tintColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
      tintOpacity: 0
    choice:
      prompt: 
      options: []
    endingScene: {fileID: 0}
    music: {fileID: 0}
    music2: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - sentenceType: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 31131cf5c56fa144b8d10d79464f4bf3, type: 2}
    text: Keep your eyes up and your hands visible. People relax when you look calm.
    actions:
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2e240942c73318642b0f986813494e10, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 12
      actionType: 0
      coords: {x: -200, y: 0}
      moveSpeed: 0
      tintColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
      tintOpacity: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 31131cf5c56fa144b8d10d79464f4bf3, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 1
      actionType: 4
      coords: {x: 200, y: 0}
      moveSpeed: 0
      tintColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
      tintOpacity: 0
    choice:
      prompt: 
      options: []
    endingScene: {fileID: 0}
    music: {fileID: 0}
    music2: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - sentenceType: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 359f5f6b302fa244c8f52d53c2279cfe, type: 2}
    text: A few students stiffen as the president walks past. A few wave shyly.
    actions:
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2e240942c73318642b0f986813494e10, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 12
      actionType: 0
      coords: {x: -200, y: 0}
      moveSpeed: 0
      tintColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
      tintOpacity: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 31131cf5c56fa144b8d10d79464f4bf3, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      actionType: 0
      coords: {x: 200, y: 0}
      moveSpeed: 0
      tintColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
      tintOpacity: 0
    choice:
      prompt: 
      options: []
    endingScene: {fileID: 0}
    music: {fileID: 0}
    music2: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - sentenceType: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2e240942c73318642b0f986813494e10, type: 2}
    text: Everyone seems to respect you.
    actions:
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2e240942c73318642b0f986813494e10, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 13
      actionType: 4
      coords: {x: -200, y: 0}
      moveSpeed: 0
      tintColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
